  "findings": [
    "Embers AudioPlaythrough uses the owner existing AudioSource; panLevelCustomCurve constant 0, so it is 2D. SoundDef contains three equal-weight clips, gain/pitch 1, category 1.",
    "Fatigue AudioPlayClip overrides gain to 0.800000011920929, pitch 1, spatialBlend 1 and category 1 (SoundDef category 5 is not final).",
    "Fatigue m_TemplateSource is null. GenerateAudioSource uses SoundConfig.m_PlayClipTemplate, not the AudioSource on the Fatigue SoundDef. Config points to template -8545291008535992616.",
    "The recovered template has rolloffMode 1 (linear), MinDistance 100, MaxDistance 500, DopplerLevel 1, spread 0, reverb zone mix 1 and no mixer group. Template panLevel starts at 0; action subsequently sets spatialBlend 1.",
    "InitSourceTransform parents generated source to SoundManager.SceneObject and snapshots the supplied FX object world position. It does not follow the FX transform.",
    "BoardCameras root is identity. Dedicated enabled AudioListener local position is [-7.801186561584473,1,-4.937725067138672], identity rotation. Main Camera AudioListener is disabled. Dedicated listener also owns an enabled AudioReverbZone."
  ],
  "remaining_gaps": [
    "Host supplies original Unity world position of FX -9117196804631356181 at Birth via optional API; a raw 2D screen position is not acceptable.",
    "Static recovered listener configuration is available; runtime listener changes and exact Unity native panning/reverb/doppler output are not demonstrated.",
    "Godot SFX bus and global mix are compatibility adapters, not proof of Unity category ducking/reverb parity."
  ],
  "implementation": "No invented listener or emitter world coordinates, attenuation curve, panning or reverb. Existing two-dimensional playback retained with explicit remaining panning/reverb gap. play_burn(serial, original_unity_world_position) now reports a source linear-distance-gain diagnostic. Friendly source endpoint plus FX offset gives distance 7.6903317861, enemy 6.4413358675, both below min100 and hence original distance attenuation gain1. Audit distinguishes original spatialBlend 0 embers from spatialBlend 1 Fatigue."
